[en.FOCUS_C01_STRENGTHEN_PROPAGANDA]
Who Controls the Past

[en.FOCUS_C01_STRENGTHEN_PROPAGANDA_desc]
“Who controls the past controls the future. Who controls the present controls the past.”

[zh.FOCUS_C01_STRENGTHEN_PROPAGANDA]
谁掌握了过去

[zh.FOCUS_C01_STRENGTHEN_PROPAGANDA_desc]
“谁掌握了过去，谁就掌握了未来。谁掌握了现在，谁就掌握了过去。”

